Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《猩球崛起》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 好的... 现在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, okay... now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是哪只? 9号?  - 是的 9号 亮眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which one's this, number9?  - Yeah, number 9. Bright eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you watching this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这 这简直是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This, this is unbelieveable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他用了几步?  - 20步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many moves was that?  - 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最完美的做法是15步 天啊 你给她吃了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The perfect score is 15. God, what, what are you giving her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 把那个录像给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, give me that video!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9号大猩猩 我们只给了她一剂药剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chimp number 9, just one dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能等等来吗?  - 我们已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Couldn't I see you later?  - We're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一会儿再打给你 嗯 好的 谢谢 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to call you back. Yeah, all right.  Thanks, Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,112号药剂 它有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}112, it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 只是在一只灵长类动物身上生效?  - 一只就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On just the one primate?  - One is all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认知能力的完全恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full cognitive recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定自己没有太心急吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, are you sure you're not rushing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经研究这个五年半了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been working on this for five and a half years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些数据很清楚了 我们准备好了 史蒂芬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The data is clear. We're ready, Steven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就差你批准人体试验了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I need is your approval for human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个啊 你需要董事会的批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, for this, you're going to need the Board's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个项目上投资了很多钱 威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of money riding on this, Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你只有一次机会  - 一次就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You only get one shot.  - One shot is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我需要看你所有的研究成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'll need to see all the research.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有 威尔...  - 嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, and Will...  - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要把你的私人感情牵涉进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your personal emotions out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人投资要看到成果 而不是梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people invest in results, not dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来见见9号猩猩 她正在完成一个叫卢卡斯塔的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet chimp 9. Here she's tasking at what is called the Lucas Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个游戏的目标是要把这个塔从一根柱子移到另一根柱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The object of which is to move the tower from peg to peg
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个过程中大盘不能放在小盘上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without placing a larger block on top of a smaller block.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正如我们预料的一样 她完全无法完成这个谜题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As expected, she was unable to complete the puzzle at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来 我们给她注射了名为ALZ-112的药物 这是一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, we gave her what we call, ALZ-112, a gene therapy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以让大脑创造细胞进行自我修复的基因药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that allows the brain to create its own cells in order to repair itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在生物学中 这叫神经形成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In biology, this is called neurogenesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里 在GEN-SYS\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, at GEN-SYS,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把它叫做治疗老年痴呆症的神药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we call it a cure to Alzheimer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 唐尼 你让她准备好了吗?  - 她怯场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Donnie, you get her ready?  - She's got stage fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要把我的手都弄断了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna break my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮眼睛! 放手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bright Eyes! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经准备好进入下一阶段了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ready to move on to the next phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人体试验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你 亮眼睛 你最爱的气泡苏打水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, Bright Eyes. It's your favorite fizzy soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 准备好 唐尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把她搞到楼下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should have her downstairs already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好姑娘!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 姑娘 对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on out, girl, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住她!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.55,0:06:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唐尼 把笼子打开! 打开! 打开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, open the cage! Open up! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.53,0:06:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要给她打镇定剂了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going to sedate her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要!  - 把门关上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no!  - Get the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要! 等等! 就现在!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no! Hold it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呼叫支援! 唐尼 唐尼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call help! Donnie, Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前112号药剂只出现过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been absolutely no side effects associated
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种副作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with 112, with one exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由于某种原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猩猩的虹膜上出现了绿色的斑点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the chimps irises exhibit flecks of green.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实 我们最初是在9号猩猩上注意到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, we first noticed it in chimp 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以才给它起了"亮眼睛"这个外号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hence her nickname, Bright Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一会儿你们就会看到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see when we bring her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理论上 这种药物可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In theory, this therapy can be used
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,治疗很多不同种类的脑科疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to treat a wide range of brain disorders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的潜力是无限的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's virtually limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以给我们带来巨大的收益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As are the potential profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why we are confident that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会批准人体试验的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will vote to approve human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅各布斯先生 雅各布斯先生 我求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jacobs, Mr. Jacobs I am begging you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我求你了 别这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am begging you, not to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 其实只要花一小笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it costs a small fortune to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以给这些猩猩做一个检测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}run lab workups on all of those chimps
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.78,0:08:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但结果显而易见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only to tell me what I already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们都被感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they are contaminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事关它们的生命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are lives at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些动物有个性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These, these are animals with personalities,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with attachments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 感情?  - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Attachments?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这是在做生意 不是在开宠物园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I run a a business, not a petting zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用最省钱的方式把这些猩猩杀掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the most cost effective way to put those apes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是猩猩管理员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the chimp handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就解决问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史蒂芬!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steven!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚的事真有趣!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把112号药剂带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken the 112.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,董事会驳回了你的提案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Board has rejected your proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们选择开发别的项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've chosen to advance other programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你总能做点什么的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there must be something that you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我可以把你炒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. There is, I could fire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 我们已经谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, we talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有五年令人信服的数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have five years of conclusive data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些数据随便你怎么处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parade all the data you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你再也无法说服任何人对你投资了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will never convince anyone to invest another dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种药有救命的潜力!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This drug has the potential to save lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更像是让公司破产的潜力吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bankrupt this company, more like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 你对人类大脑了解得那么透彻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, you know everything about the human brain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但就是不知道别人的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except the way it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从头开始研究112号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to the drawing board on the 112.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从分子阶段重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start again in molecular development.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试着在别人研究出来之前成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find a way to get there before someone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 收拾好这烂摊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富兰克林!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franklin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只很小 我们把她带来的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very small. She must have been
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定已经怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pregnant when we brought her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以她才...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不是进攻性强 她只是想保护她的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wasn't being aggressive. She was just being protective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她以为我们想伤害她的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thought we were going to hurt her baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想自己领养它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would take it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我小舅子在保安处工作 他肯定会把我供出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my brother-in-law works for security. He'd rat me out in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我领养它?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you want me to take it home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么照顾猴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't take care of a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他不是猴子! 他是猩猩  - 富兰克林...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's not a monkey! He's an ape.  - Franklin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要照顾他几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's just for a couple days until
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会找到一个避难所 这就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find a sanctuary. That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富兰克林 不行!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franklin, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我的责任范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this isn't my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是公司财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This, this is company property.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you what, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅各布斯让我把另外12只都杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacobs made me put down the other 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你请便吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿!  - 哦 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey!  - Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看上去精神不好  - 是啊 他怎么样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look beat.  - Yeah. How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时好时坏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he has good days and bad days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天不怎么样 不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, not so good, although he
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他开始背诵莎士比亚的剧本了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been quoting Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你搞来了一只宠物?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you got a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 他只在我们家暂时留宿几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, it's just a temporary house guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 也许这对他有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe that'll be good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 爸爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔! 我没听见你进门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will! I didn't hear you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就今天了 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today's the day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会忘记吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought I'd forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天有场大考 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a big test today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,化学?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chemistry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 爸...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我给你看样东西怎么样?  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to see something?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?他 受伤了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that? Is he injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我觉得那是胎记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think that's a birthmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"对凯撒 只有跪下 跪伏并惊叹!"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"As for Caesar, kneel down, kneel down and wonder!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别太投入感情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, don't get too attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他真可爱 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a cute little guy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的车钥匙呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my car keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的车钥匙 你把它们放哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My car keys, where'd you put 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸... 你已经不开车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad,...you a, you don't drive anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.61,0:13:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来喂他吧 你会吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you feed him. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, I can..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔! 快来看!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他多大了? 一天? 两天?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How old is he? Like, a day old? Two days old?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他真聪明 是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a smart one, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算给他取什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to name him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.75,0:14:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三年后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快 凯撒展现了非常高的智力水平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right away, Caesar displayed signs of heightened intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我收养了他 然后开始在家里工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I kept him. And, brought my work home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十八个月后 凯撒认识24个单词了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By 18 months, Caesar was signing up to 24 words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两岁时 凯撒可以完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By age two, Caesar completing puzzles and models
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为八岁及以上的儿童设计的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}designed for children eight years and up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三岁时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At age three,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒继续展现高超的认知技能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar continues to show cognative skills
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.99,0:15:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比同龄人类都要强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that far exceed that of his human counterpart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家... 家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home... home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以15步的满分成绩完成了卢卡斯塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He completed the Lucas Tower in 15 moves, a perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是有几个假设: 一 他眼睛中的绿色斑点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I maintain my hypothesis that: A. The green in his eyes indicate
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说明了ALZ-112从母亲遗传到了孩子身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the ALZ-112 was passed genetically from mother to son
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二 由于大脑中没有受到损伤的细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, B. That in the absence of damaged cells that need to be replacing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他体内的药物刺激了他的大脑功能快速发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the drug in his system has radically boosted healthy brain functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And,...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他下象棋很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he plays chess pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起  - 我再也做不到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry.  - I can't do this, anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该被送到养老院里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He belongs in a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样他根本没法过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no way for him to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没法过?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把灯都打破了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I broke my lamp...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会让你好起来的 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll make you better, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陶德 进来吃早饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Todd, come inside for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会记录我从实验室带来的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need to keep track of what I take from the lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我觉得你一个月注射一次就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although I don't see you needing more than one treatment a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太神奇了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something amazing has happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要做个血液测试 一次扫描...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need a blood test, a scan and the dosage...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还得控制用药量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}carefully monitored.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能溜进...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if I can sneak...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.97,0:18:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔! 我已经好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will! I'm not sick, anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nothing, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:19:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 凯撒在哪? 我要见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ceasar. Where's Caesar? I want to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定没有走远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't have gone far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸比!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去! 滚出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿嘿... 够了! 够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey... Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果再让我发现有动物出现在我家门口 或者接近我的孩子们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I catch that animal anywhere near my house or my kids, again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有下次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 不会了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn right, it won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 走吧 爸  - 他只是想玩玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Dad.  - He, he just wanted to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待在家里! 爸爸保护你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in the house! Daddy's got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说不要一个人出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you not to go out without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况多糟糕?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他喜欢你  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He likes you.  - Uh, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 马上就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. It'll be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们一起去搞点东西吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, we can go get a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想 冰淇淋怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking, ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你教他打手语?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You taught him to sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只教了一些基础的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just, handful of things, basic stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你觉得我们什么时候该来复诊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, when do you think we should come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不用再来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you won't need to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些线是可溶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because, um, the stiches are dissolveable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意一下有没有感染的症状就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would just say, watch for signs of infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发烧啊... 发红啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fever... redness...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.89,0:21:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 他现在在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what's he saying, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well,...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得我们俩应该一起吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he thinks that you and I should have dinner together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒! 来吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡洛琳 又见到你了 真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, again, Caroline.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也来吗 凯撒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You coming, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的秘诀是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's your secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实这不是我的功劳 他的基因比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I can't take any credit. It's in his genes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你太谦虚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're being very modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他真的很惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你为凯撒造的家真的很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you've built a pretty good home for Caesar, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这维持不了多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know he won't stay this way for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他马上就会长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to soon grow into
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变成一只巨大 有力量的动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a large, powerful, animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.43,0:21:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's he been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.41,0:22:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love chimpanzees.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也挺怕他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm also afraid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怕他们也是自然的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, it's appropriate to be afraid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒不会伤害别人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar will never hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这里很快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.82,0:22:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们至少应该给他一点自由活动的空间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can at least give him some open space?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.81,0:22:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这应该不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That would prpbably be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.77,0:22:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 过了桥有个好地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a place right across the bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红树林 像天堂一样美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Redwoods. It's a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不需要绳索了! 没问题 快过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't need a leash! He'll be fine. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 仅仅为了安全考虑  - 来啊 凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just to be safe.  - Come on, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是红树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the redwoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.27,0:23:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把它解开 但是你不可以离开我的视线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I take this off you can not leave my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.37,0:23:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就再也找不到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never find you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么?  - 他在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this?  - What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我简直不能相信!  - 怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't believe that!  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在征得你的同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's asking your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个恳求的手势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a supplicating gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 凯撒! 去玩吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Caesar! Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.55,0:23:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他多高兴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 凯撒!!  - 凯撒!!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Caesar!!  - Caesar!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.73,0:24:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧 凯撒 爬上去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Caesar, climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再高一点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.27,0:24:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爬啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.72,0:24:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.75,0:24:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 小心点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.54,0:25:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五年后
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.18,0:25:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.65,0:25:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 伙计?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.51,0:25:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来碰下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.31,0:25:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 小宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是只猩猩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a chimpanzee?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.27,0:25:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.35,0:26:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒! 凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar! Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.36,0:26:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.14,0:26:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别计较 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.03,0:26:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.69,0:26:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.25,0:26:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要进去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you getting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.64,0:26:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.66,0:26:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.58,0:26:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是宠物吗? 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you pet? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:27:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是我的宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.07,0:27:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.41,0:27:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒是怎么来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.25,0:27:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.85,0:27:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 这里是我工作的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar, this is where I work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.88,0:27:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是你出生的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is were you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时你母亲和她的同伴都在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother was here with other chimpanzees.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她现在不在这了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she's not here, anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.29,0:27:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.46,0:27:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才把你带回家和我一起生活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's why I took home to live with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.70,0:27:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的母亲死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.08,0:28:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上 她被注射了药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing is, she was given medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正如我给查尔斯注射的药物一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the medicine I give to Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.42,0:28:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她把它遗传给了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She passed it on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才会这么聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们带他回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.71,0:28:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 解释一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, explain it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.39,0:28:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.38,0:28:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了让他活命 我把它偷偷带出实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I snuck him out of the lab to save his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.20,0:28:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到药效会被母亲遗传给它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no idea that the effects had been transfered vertically from his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.21,0:28:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但从那时起 他就表现出了不可思议地高智商行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, since then, he's been displaying incredible signs intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我设计了112号药剂用来修复 但凯撒的表现远超出预期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I designed the 112 to repair, but Caesar's gone way beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:29:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他去年以来的智商表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's his IQ from last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.66,0:29:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到现在 他的智商提高了一倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since then, it's doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.06,0:29:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.70,0:29:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的父亲曾经不能自理 这药剂让他重获新生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was on gone. This drug brought him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没见过他有多么糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never saw how bad he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.80,0:29:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他拥有了正常的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has his life again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那凯撒怎么办?  - 什么怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And, what about Caesar?  - What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么生活下去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does he fit in?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我... 和我们一起...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With me... with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.05,0:29:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这对你来说很难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it has been hard for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你在试图操控我们绝对不应该插手的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you are trying to control things that were never meant to be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.23,0:29:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,112号药剂是有效的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 112 works.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.47,0:29:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你意识到你有多疯狂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you realize how you sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.08,0:29:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说它是很棒的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I'm saying is this is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒就是证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar's proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.69,0:29:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.64,0:29:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 吃点东西吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar, eat your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.08,0:30:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸 你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.68,0:30:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.11,0:30:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抗体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antibodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.93,0:30:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的免疫系统找到了对抗112病毒的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His system has found a way to fight the 112 virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.19,0:30:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因此它没办法发挥疗效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that it can't deliver its therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.17,0:30:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲的病会更严重的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father's disease is going to return with a vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.11,0:31:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.20,0:31:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下来 马上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.89,0:31:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 离开那! 从车里滚出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Get out there! Get out of that car!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.34,0:31:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的在干嘛? 从我的车里滚出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing? Get out of my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.80,0:31:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了 从我的车里滚出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, get out of my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.01,0:31:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是飞行员! 我得赶去机场!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a pilot! I've got to get to the airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.83,0:31:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我怎么去那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I gonna get there now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.14,0:31:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回答我的问题! 你到底在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer the God-damn question! What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.61,0:31:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有台一模一样的车...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a car just exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.78,0:31:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完蛋了... 警察会来处理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done... the police can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.46,0:31:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就待在这! 你哪都不能去 先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay right there! You aren't going nowhere, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.18,0:32:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会付出代价的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.19,0:32:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的问题 你造成了现在这种局面!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your problem, you make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.42,0:32:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你没完! 就待在这!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not through with you! Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.38,0:32:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 停下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.21,0:32:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.02,0:33:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.42,0:33:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.15,0:33:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是故意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.85,0:33:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.06,0:33:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 把那玩意拿下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, take that thing off of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.02,0:33:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那玩意拿下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that thing off of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.19,0:34:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我来它带进去 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll take him in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.58,0:34:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 法院命令扣押他 我们不能放开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's under court orders. We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系! 随他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine! Let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.06,0:34:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好的时候再带他进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him in when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.46,0:34:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.30,0:34:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 凯撒 凯撒... 凯撒 凯撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar, Caesar, Caesar... Caesar, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.96,0:34:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还不是时候 但一切都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not right now. It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.77,0:34:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就进去看看里面什么样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just see what it's like inside, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.86,0:34:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 凯撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.22,0:34:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.75,0:34:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧... 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on... trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.85,0:34:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.19,0:34:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.15,0:35:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从来没和其他猩猩相处过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't spent any time with other chimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.52,0:35:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种情况我们见多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we're used to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.42,0:35:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚开始他会有点暴躁敏感 但是我们会让他融入进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be a little skittish at first, but we'll integrate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.07,0:35:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能很快适应环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be surprised how quick they adapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.30,0:35:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们提供了适宜的生存环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We provide a stimulating environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.03,0:35:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会在这愉快地生活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to thrive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.54,0:35:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 我们签写书面文件吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, let's do some paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.42,0:35:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来之前确保把门锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you lock that door when you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.26,0:35:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.60,0:35:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.59,0:35:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会好起来的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's going to be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.77,0:35:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.54,0:35:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前 你要待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to stay here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.50,0:36:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不... 还不能回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No... Not going home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别拖拖拉拉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.73,0:36:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道别拖得越久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The longer you drag out the good-byes,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.32,0:36:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会变得越难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the harder it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.28,0:36:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能待会再签吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I sign that later?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.07,0:36:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的思念可能会更深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll probably miss him more than he'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.51,0:36:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好给他几周适应环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd best give him a couple of weeks to get used too the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.12,0:36:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.92,0:36:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.72,0:36:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快会再回来的 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming back soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.32,0:36:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来之前打个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just call ahead, before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.67,0:36:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.15,0:36:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能救你出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I can get you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.94,0:36:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来! 来这边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!  Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.66,0:37:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.69,0:37:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢猴子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.84,0:37:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还不过来? 搞定他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you? Come on, make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.59,0:38:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,法庭判决还没下来 因此系统里没有记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Court order hasn't been filed, so it's not in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.10,0:38:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦有消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once it comes through,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.15,0:38:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你收到上诉日期前差不多要90天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will take about 90 days before you receive an appeal date.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 90天?  - 没错 先生 90天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 90 days?  - Yes, sir, 90 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.24,0:38:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将收到邮件通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be notified by mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.38,0:38:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是接下来要发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你再到你的电脑里好好查查 然后给我个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to go back to your computer, you know, shift things around
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.76,0:38:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确切的上诉日期 这周内的 明白了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're going to get me a date for my appeal, this week, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.57,0:38:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.60,0:38:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.19,0:38:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为除非你照我说的做 我不会走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, I'm not moving until you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.22,0:38:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,90天 先生 能有上诉日期你就偷笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}90 days, sir. Be thankful you're talking about court dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.26,0:38:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有弄死你的猩猩已经很幸运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky they didn't put that animal down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.36,0:38:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证很快把他带回来 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised to get him back soon, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.52,0:38:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.15,0:38:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲的免疫系统一直在抵触112号病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father's immune system continues to reject the 112 virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.98,0:38:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,导致基因疗法不起作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rendering the gene therapy obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.93,0:38:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的健康状况不断恶化 并且疾病发展迅速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his health is deteriorating, and the disease is progressing rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.21,0:38:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一种更具攻击性的病原体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a more aggressive virus strain,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.64,0:39:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种能更快发生作用的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a faster delivery method,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.57,0:39:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为在这个时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because at this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.18,0:39:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能同时失去他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't lose them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.48,0:39:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会失去他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't lose them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.72,0:39:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨... 能聊聊吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi... Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.25,0:39:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 我还有会议要参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it fast.  I've got a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.20,0:39:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十年来你一直在经营GEN-SYS公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ten years you have been running GEN-SYS,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.44,0:39:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,流水线上制造出来的多少种药物可以拯救无数人的生命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how many drugs have come down the pipeline that could save millions of lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.59,0:39:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以改变一切?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could change everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.85,0:39:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.52,0:39:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,ALZ-112号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ALZ-112.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.15,0:39:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 威尔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you, Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.50,0:39:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经你是这个实验室的明星 而现在你几乎不露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to be the star of this lab. Now, you hardly ever show
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.25,0:39:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你出现的时候 你也在浪费自己和团队的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when you do, you waste your time and that of your team's
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.30,0:39:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,研究一种药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fixating on a drug
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那些事情发生之后 这研究就不可能有任何前景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that, after what happened, is never ever going to get approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.40,0:39:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,112号药剂很危险 威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 112 is dangerous, Will,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.34,0:40:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且它不管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.85,0:40:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用它治好了我的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I treated my father with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.24,0:40:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它确实有作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.49,0:40:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.72,0:40:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底做了什么!?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did, what!?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.12,0:40:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战胜了疾病 正如我们预期的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beat the disease, like we predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.43,0:40:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.01,0:40:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但有一个复杂的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a complication.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是否真的起作用了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, does it work or doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.18,0:40:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲的病比疗效更来势汹汹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father's disease eventually outran the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.85,0:40:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 上帝保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, for goodness sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.37,0:40:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,免疫系统会产生抗体来对抗这种病毒组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The immune system produced antibodies to beat the viral component,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.79,0:40:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但它会起作用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.32,0:40:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经研制出了一种病原体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've have already developed a virus strain
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.60,0:40:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它会更具攻击性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I think will be more aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.68,0:40:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么认为?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.89,0:40:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要让我做些测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just, let me test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.87,0:40:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在浪费我的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.24,0:40:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有更多改进!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.23,0:40:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疗效将会比疾病速度更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The applications go beyond the disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.00,0:40:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有数据显示这种疗法可以提高认知系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are indications that show the therapy can improve cognitive functioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.17,0:40:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记忆能力...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}memory quality...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.54,0:40:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.85,0:40:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的父亲不仅仅恢复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father didn't just recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.62,0:40:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他变得更健康了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.72,0:40:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你指的是提高智力水平?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, increased intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.86,0:40:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有定论 但确实是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not conclusive, but yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.82,0:41:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你立刻在猩猩身上实验修复后的112号药剂 越快越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you, to start testing the revised 112 on chimps, A-S-A-P.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.17,0:41:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你一切你要的东西 只要你立刻开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you whatever you need, but get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.19,0:41:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃晚饭了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.65,0:41:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大猩猩 灵长类!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Ape, primate!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.64,0:41:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 看到这玩意还不知道吃吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, don't you know food when you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.27,0:41:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得很有趣?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think that's funny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.94,0:41:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来告诉你什么叫做有趣!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I show you something funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.24,0:42:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就会知道谁是老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll learn who's boss, soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.64,0:42:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还穿着衣服怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about his clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.93,0:42:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,衣服怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.92,0:42:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道... 可能会被其他猩猩当作异类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know... May cause problems with the other apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.94,0:42:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.71,0:43:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一共十只猩猩 没错吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I counted ten apes, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.77,0:43:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 都运到后面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.  All the way to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.23,0:43:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们行动太快了 着什么急啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are moving really quick on this. What's the big rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一天复工 你依然在抱怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First day back, you're still complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.53,0:43:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科巴 你好 我是威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koba. Hi, I'm Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.02,0:44:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.28,0:44:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.63,0:44:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.22,0:44:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他经历过很多实验 他知道规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been through a whole lot of labs. He knows the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.79,0:44:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能加入吗 看看你们的进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I join you, what's our progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.87,0:44:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.49,0:44:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴好面罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tighten your masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.44,0:44:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把113号递给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass me the 113.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.07,0:44:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脉搏很有力 血压稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulse-ox is good, blood pressure is steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.71,0:44:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,药物注射剂 到位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perisol delivery, in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.11,0:44:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,释放113号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Releasing the 113.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.87,0:45:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有泄露!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.79,0:45:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富兰克林 戴好面具!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franklin, get your mask on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.25,0:45:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞定了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.70,0:45:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.82,0:45:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.13,0:45:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都起来动一动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!  Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.59,0:45:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都起来运动运动 你们这些懒狒狒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up and do some exercises you lazy baboons!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.58,0:48:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,智力测评结果非常棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intelligence results are remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.92,0:48:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有不良反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no adverse effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.19,0:48:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猩猩们有惊人地强大免疫系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apes have amazingly strong immune systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.53,0:48:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好好照顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.52,0:48:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.12,0:48:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.38,0:48:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙比我还有抵抗力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are more resiliant than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.35,0:48:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出去一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.23,0:49:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你伤得严重吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seriously injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.27,0:49:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道手语吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know sign language?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.83,0:49:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在马戏团工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I worked at the circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.68,0:49:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.08,0:49:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 人类不喜欢有智商的猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful. Humans do not like intelligent apes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.04,0:49:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚要工作到很晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're working late tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.16,0:49:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,GEN-SYS公司还需要三只猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GEN-SYS needs three more.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.90,0:50:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.12,0:50:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.75,0:50:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.39,0:50:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 把手给我 把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar, give me your hand. Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.59,0:50:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候 新来的总会被教训一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes, the new kid on the block gets picked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.79,0:50:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持冷静 他们做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay calm. What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.43,0:50:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扯淡!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.73,0:50:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the problem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.51,0:50:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带他离开这里 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking him out of here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.68,0:50:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有法院命令不可以带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without a court order, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.04,0:50:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他再也不是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not yours, anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.30,0:50:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 如果我发现他受到任何形式的虐待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise, if I find out he's been mistreated in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.50,0:50:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让这地方关门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have this place shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.21,0:50:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随你便...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.19,0:51:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们不能马上回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.  No, we're not going home, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.24,0:51:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会带你离开这里的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get you out of here, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.30,0:51:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.09,0:51:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒 你一定要相信我 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar, you have to trust me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.60,0:51:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探视结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this visit's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.77,0:51:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.98,0:51:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.34,0:52:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 走啦! 我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move it! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.48,0:53:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有成百上千只猩猩! 好像你有了私人动物园一样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are hundreds of them! Looks like you're own private zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.65,0:53:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更像是这些毛茸茸家伙的监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rather like a prison for hairy dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.11,0:53:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会看电视?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They watch TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.70,0:53:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们管这叫提升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call it enrichment.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.18,0:53:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这只真可爱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, this one's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.35,0:53:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.70,0:53:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫柯妮丽娅 她是母的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, name's Cornelia. It's a she.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.25,0:53:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.09,0:53:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别靠太近!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.99,0:53:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只把我吓得半死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one scared me half to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.96,0:53:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只大家伙叫毛里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That big guy is called, Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.20,0:53:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.15,0:53:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 我给你看点有意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, I'll show you something fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.68,0:53:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太疯狂了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.51,0:53:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.83,0:53:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 下个就是你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.04,0:53:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.35,0:53:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看样子 我们在这里花了太多时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We spent too much time in here, as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:53:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.67,0:54:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.37,0:54:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿兰 他不是好惹的 他觉得自己很特别之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Alan, he's a pain in the ass. He thinks he's special, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.75,0:54:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捉摸不透的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.66,0:54:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.66,0:54:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他在想些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's thinking or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.02,0:54:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 他抓住他的喉咙了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, he's got him by the throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.43,0:54:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.17,0:54:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.43,0:54:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.25,0:54:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.32,0:54:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过不要靠太近的 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you not to get too close, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.59,0:54:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 各位 我们出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.99,0:59:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事不需要被改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things aren't meant be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.45,0:59:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要接受它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.35,0:59:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.58,0:59:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.14,0:59:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.92,0:59:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再做些113号药剂的试验 我们在做准备...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More 113 trials. We're just prepping...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们必须先分析科巴的血液!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, we have to analyze Koba's blood work first!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.25,0:59:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富兰克林知道流程 他在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franklin knows this. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.23,0:59:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他请了两天病假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's out sick for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.90,0:59:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有批准这次试验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I didn't authorized this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.43,0:59:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.44,0:59:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我批准的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.00,0:59:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们同意在一只猩猩上做保守测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We agreed to test sparingly on one subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.44,0:59:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只猩猩太令人吃惊了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, that one subject is stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.11,0:59:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是种病毒 我们不知道它对人类的影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a virus. We don't know the human related effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.93,0:59:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,药物起作用了 威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The drug works, Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.63,0:59:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他 琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.05,0:59:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始 科巴以15步的满分成绩完成了卢卡斯塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For starters, Koba scored a perfect 15 on the Lucas Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次测试的结果都验证了它的有效性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every test result verifies its effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.23,1:00:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不能再测试了  - 你在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No more tests.  - What are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.84,1:00:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们弄明白我们在做什么之前 不能继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not until we have a better understanding of what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.86,1:00:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我会明确告诉你我们做的是什么 听着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll tell you exactly what we do. Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.89,1:00:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我几分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.78,1:00:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦一下! 把猩猩放回笼子里 温柔点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me! Put the ape back in the cage. Be gentle.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.49,1:00:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔 我明确告诉你我们在这里做的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, I'll tell you exactly what we're dealing with, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.72,1:00:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在研究一种药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dealing with a drug that is worth more
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.98,1:00:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它比我们研究合成的任何药物都更有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than everything else we are developing, combined.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.21,1:00:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你创造历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make history,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.16,1:00:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我挣钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make money.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.63,1:00:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不就是我们的安排吗?  - 不! 这有风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that our arrangement?  - No! There are risks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.14,1:00:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别跟我讲风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you tell me about risks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.03,1:00:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给你自己爸爸吃试验阶段的药物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give your own father an experimental drug.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.26,1:00:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一通电话就能结束你的职业生涯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could finish your career with one phone call.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.85,1:00:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你省点麻烦吧 我退出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll save you the trouble. I quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.57,1:00:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你 我们也会继续的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will proceed without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.63,1:00:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着... 你不知道自己在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look... You do not know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.07,1:00:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些测试应该被限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These tests need to be contained.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.07,1:00:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不知道113号药剂是否稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea if the 113 is stable,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.36,1:00:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它会对人类造成怎样的伤害...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what kind of damage it can do to people...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.00,1:00:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们先在猩猩上做试验... 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that is why we test it on chimps... isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.51,1:01:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗德曼博士 是我 富兰克林! 我要跟你谈谈!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Rodman, it's, me, Franklin! I need to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.28,1:01:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以开门吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you come to the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.39,1:01:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博士!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.08,1:01:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.49,1:01:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.24,1:01:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起... 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.12,1:01:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会是想收买我吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't be trying to entrap me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.13,1:01:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个... 我不敢说同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... I can't say that I approve.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.90,1:01:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是人 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not people, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.68,1:01:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你放不放他走?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna to let him go or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.72,1:02:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒... 嘿 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar... hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.56,1:02:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 我们回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we're go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.68,1:02:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.11,1:02:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 我们真的要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we're really going.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.03,1:02:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.00,1:02:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对... 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah... Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.62,1:02:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.23,1:02:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜和自己的家相比 他更喜欢这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess he likes it better here with his own kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.50,1:05:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么发曲奇饼 火箭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why cookies, Rocket?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.43,1:05:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一只猴子... 很弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A single monkey... is weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.19,1:05:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猴子们聚在一起... 就有力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkeys together... a force.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猴子都是没脑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkeys are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.23,1:06:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 罗德尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Rodney,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.98,1:06:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又把水管留在中房了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You leave the hose out in the atrium, again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.04,1:06:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 没有!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.97,1:08:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧! 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!  Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.62,1:08:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.82,1:09:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在发射八个月后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight months after its launch,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.16,1:09:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球的首个飞向火星的载人飞船...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth's first manned space flight to Mars...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.61,1:09:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会逃避 我说的是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't dodging. I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.52,1:09:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 如果不是我拿的曲奇饼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, if I've didn't take the cookies,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.93,1:09:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还能是谁干的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then, who the hell did?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.75,1:09:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我 我不知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, I do not know...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.00,1:09:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 你们俩傻子别闹了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Will you two morons knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.48,1:09:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.78,1:09:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星球表面有水 这样才能维持生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covered in water and therefore able to sustain life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.21,1:09:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的猩猩房都比你俩太平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get more peace in the God-damned ape house.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.02,1:09:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 对不起!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.41,1:10:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富兰克林先生 我是多蒂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Franklin, it's Dottie!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.03,1:11:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富兰克林先生... 有人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Franklin... Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.38,1:11:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.73,1:11:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗德尼 立刻到猩猩放风的地方来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rodney, get to the platform, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.06,1:11:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗德尼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rodney!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.18,1:12:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的以为你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you think you're doing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.97,1:12:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.83,1:12:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.50,1:12:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到你的笼子里去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back in your cage!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.77,1:12:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在警告你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.16,1:12:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走啊 进去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, get!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.28,1:12:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.34,1:12:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你自找的! 回去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you get! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.61,1:12:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.62,1:12:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,臭猴子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumb monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.02,1:13:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把臭爪子松开 你个脏猩猩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your stinking paw off me, you damn dirty ape!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.23,1:13:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.85,1:13:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.72,1:13:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.32,1:13:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.53,1:14:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.28,1:14:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会打死你们每一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll beat each and everyone of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.54,1:15:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡洛琳 你去过凯撒的房间吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caroline, have you been up to Caesar's room?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.26,1:15:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's answering.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.91,1:16:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兰登!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Landon!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.39,1:17:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.03,1:17:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.42,1:17:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.92,1:17:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He spoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.21,1:17:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什... 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you...what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.41,1:17:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的猩猩... 他说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ape... he spoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.83,1:18:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.91,1:18:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.55,1:18:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会打死你们每一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll beat each and everyone of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.27,1:18:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要有人联系旧金山警察局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need someone to coordinate with the S.F.P.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.98,1:18:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们 有人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them we got a fatality.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.29,1:18:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.01,1:18:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他去了哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where he's headed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.72,1:18:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.12,1:18:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.89,1:19:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅各布斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacobs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.82,1:19:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅各布斯先生 我是威尔团队的琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jacobs, It's Linda from Will's team.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.08,1:19:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 有可怕的事情发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, something terrible has happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.98,1:19:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富兰克林死于病毒感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franklin is dead from a viral infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.98,1:19:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.80,1:19:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他吸入过113号药剂 它对猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was exposed to the 113. It does something
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.23,1:19:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有副作用 对人类却有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to people that it doesn't do to apes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.08,1:19:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须穿过城市 横过大桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to go through the city and across the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.76,1:19:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅各布斯先生? 雅各布斯先生 你在听吗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jacobs? Mr. Jacobs, are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.93,1:19:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.41,1:20:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是史蒂芬·雅各布斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Steven Jacobs!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.02,1:20:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里到处都是猩猩 我得上直升机!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's full of apes in there. I gotta get in the air!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.28,1:20:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须有能力毁灭他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to be able to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.72,1:20:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事就相信我吧! 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just, trust me on this! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.78,1:20:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该把相机准备好 一般来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to get your cameras ready. Normally,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.02,1:20:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙是非常害羞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these guys are quit shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.24,1:21:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们去了北边的公园!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going the park, on the north side!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.14,1:21:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到领头的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the lead!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.35,1:21:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要抓着按钮! 按钮!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta hold the button! The button!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.62,1:21:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们被引领了 这些猩猩比你想的要聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're being led.  These apes are smarter than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.63,1:21:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有一个领袖!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got a leader!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.63,1:23:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟他们说我堵车了 找个好点的理由!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not tell them I am stuck in traffic. Make up with something smarter!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.97,1:23:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.24,1:23:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.64,1:23:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在桥上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.22,1:23:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想去红杉树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're trying to get to the redwoods.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.26,1:23:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旧金山警局 一号直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SFPD, Police 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.81,1:23:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是空中指挥部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Air Ops,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.53,1:23:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,封锁南端桥头 那些部队的情况怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seal of south end. What's the status of those units?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.03,1:23:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备就绪 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.13,1:23:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他们到了你那里 就拦住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as they reach you, block them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.40,1:24:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,北端 我们会把他们赶到你那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}North side, we're going to push them right to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.52,1:24:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 我们已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem. We're ready for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.36,1:24:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,北端封锁 他们绝对不能通过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The north side is blocked. They'll never get through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.87,1:24:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他们进入封锁区域 我们就干掉他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as they hit the gap, we'll take them out!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.18,1:24:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能直接杀死他们吗?  - 就像朝桶里的鱼开枪一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can just shoot them?  - Like shooting fish in a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.65,1:24:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.87,1:24:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把车开回去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn that thing around!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.91,1:24:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 离开大桥 先生  - 我不能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get off the bridge, sir.  - I can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.67,1:24:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你不明白 离开大桥 马上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand. Get off this bridge, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.87,1:24:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里被封锁了 出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an evacuation. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.42,1:24:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有市民安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the civilians, clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.75,1:24:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.69,1:24:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让那些人离开大桥!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put these people off the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.22,1:25:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备就绪 城市骑兵!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by, city mounted units!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.89,1:25:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会对猩猩进行大屠杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna slaughter them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.90,1:25:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找到凯撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna to get Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.19,1:25:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔 嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.79,1:25:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.60,1:25:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要上我的车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get to my car!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.14,1:25:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.31,1:25:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我! 我必须上我的车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go me! I have to get my car!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.65,1:26:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们往北赶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push 'em north!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.84,1:26:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别挡道!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.41,1:27:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 我们会在雾中跟丢他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, we're going to lose them in the fog.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.17,1:27:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.06,1:27:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在哪? 我没看见他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they? I don't see them!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.86,1:27:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,北端防护队 你们有看到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CHP North, do you have a visual?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.43,1:27:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 长官 没看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.22,1:28:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打开保险!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safety's off!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.52,1:28:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停止射击!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.92,1:29:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.22,1:29:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.58,1:30:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他! 他是领袖!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him! That's the leader!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.27,1:30:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们出现了! 干掉他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in sight! Put 'em down!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.81,1:31:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.93,1:31:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.96,1:32:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓我的手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.97,1:32:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, come on...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.34,1:32:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.28,1:32:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不救你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.27,1:32:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.70,1:32:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save me!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.73,1:33:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.10,1:33:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.03,1:34:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒... 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.49,1:34:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.64,1:34:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这必须结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.26,1:34:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不该是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.15,1:34:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们有什么能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what they're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.10,1:34:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.52,1:34:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你回家 我会保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you come home, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.31,1:35:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar is home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.91,1:35:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯撒回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar's home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.32,1:35:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.